<div class="alignfull cb-ctx--blue hero hero--layout-illustration wp-block-acf-hero" id="hero_1"><div class="hero__inner"><div class="hero__left"><h1 class="hero__title like-h1-upper no-default-margin">Cookiebot&trade; Consent Solution</h1> <div class="hero__description like-text-lg"><div class="like-h3">Your path to effortless website privacy compliance.</div> <p>Gain peace of mind. Achieve privacy compliance with an easy to use, automated and reliable consent solution for the GDPR and ePrivacy, Digital Markets Act (DMA), CCPA/CPRA and more.</p></div> <div class="hero__buttons"><a data-hid="fd613af4" data-pos="2" class="cb-button cb-button-contained cb-button-icon-right cb-button-size-l hero__buttons--button-0 no-default-link-decoration" href="https://admin.cookiebot.com/signup" id="f2cf045b-0ec7-4c2b-992c-d58ae7a76531" target="_blank"><span>Start trial</span></a> <div class="hero__features hero__features--button-0"><div class="hero__features-item like-text-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24"><path d="M4.9939 22.2129C4.4439 22.2129 3.97306 22.0171 3.5814 21.6254C3.18973 21.2337 2.9939 20.7629 2.9939 20.2129V6.21289C2.9939 5.66289 3.18973 5.19206 3.5814 4.80039C3.97306 4.40872 4.4439 4.21289 4.9939 4.21289H5.9939V2.21289H7.9939V4.21289H15.9939V2.21289H17.9939V4.21289H18.9939C19.5439 4.21289 20.0147 4.40872 20.4064 4.80039C20.7981 5.19206 20.9939 5.66289 20.9939 6.21289V20.2129C20.9939 20.7629 20.7981 21.2337 20.4064 21.6254C20.0147 22.0171 19.5439 22.2129 18.9939 22.2129H4.9939ZM4.9939 20.2129H18.9939V10.2129H4.9939V20.2129ZM4.9939 8.21289H18.9939V6.21289H4.9939V8.21289Z" fill="black"></path> </svg> 14-day free trial </div> <div class="hero__features-item like-text-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" height="22" viewbox="0 0 22 22" width="22"><path d="M21.125 16.85L19.35 15.075V9.925H14.2L10.2 5.925H19.35V3.925H8.2L6.2 1.925H19.35C19.9 1.925 20.3708 2.12083 20.7625 2.5125C21.1542 2.90