<div class="align cb-ctx--base cb-highlighted-numbers wp-block-acf-cb-highlighted-numbers"><div class="cb-highlighted-numbers__heading-wp"><h2 class="cb-highlighted-numbers__heading like-h3">The most used solution for compliant use of cookies and online tracking</h2> </div> <div class="cb-highlighted-numbers__cards"><div class="cb-highlighted-numbers__item"><div class="cb-highlighted-numbers__number like-h1">2.4M </div> <div class="cb-highlighted-numbers__text like-text-lg">websites and apps</div></div> <div class="cb-highlighted-numbers__item"><div class="cb-highlighted-numbers__number like-h1">8.8B</div> <div class="cb-highlighted-numbers__text like-text-lg">monthly user consents</div></div> <div class="cb-highlighted-numbers__item"><div class="cb-highlighted-numbers__number like-h1">47+</div> <div class="cb-highlighted-numbers__text like-text-lg">languages</div></div> <div class="cb-highlighted-numbers__item"><div class="cb-highlighted-numbers__number like-h1">600,000+</div> <div class="cb-highlighted-numbers__text like-text-lg">customers</div></div></div></div>

<div class="alignfull bg-brand-black cb-ctx--dark cb-flex-row--background-right has-background has-brand-black-background-color wp-block-acf-flex-row" style="padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10-xl);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10-xl)"><div class="cb-flex-row container" style="--padding-top: var(--wp--preset--spacing--10-xl); --padding-bottom: var(--wp--preset--spacing--10-xl);"><div class="cb-flex-column wp-block-acf-flex-column" style="--column-size: var(--column-size-6);--i:1;align-self:center"><h2 class="has-link-color has-text-color has-white-color wp-block-heading wp-elements-1" id="h-start-your-interactive-demo">Start your interactive demo</h2> <p class="has-link-color has-text-color has-white-color wp-block-paragraph wp-elements-2">Take this demo tour to explore how Cookiebot CMP can help you comply with regulations, automate consent signaling, and optimize consent rates for better marketing results.</p> <a data-hid="117a934c" data-pos="2" class="alignleft cb-button cb-button-contained cb-button-icon-left cb-button-left cb-button-size-m no-default-link-decoration wp-block-acf-cb-button" href="/en/product-demo/" id="59299a1c-c50a-4036-b34f-9f1bbe72023c" target=""><img decoding="async" alt="HandClickOutlined.svg?v=92fcaa8d6820b73d" data-no-lazy="" height="24" src="https://www.cookiebot.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/04/HandClickOutlined.svg?v=92fcaa8d6820b73d" width="25"><span>Explore Demo</span></a></div> <div class="cb-flex-column wp-block-acf-flex-column" style="--column-size: var(--column-size-6);--i:2"><figure class="size-large wp-block-image"><img decoding="async" alt="" src="/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/06/Demo-illustration-CB-2_for-black-background.svg" loading="lazy"></figure> </div></div></div>

<div class="alignfull cb-ctx--blue cta-block cta-block--has-shield cta-block--size-m has-background has-background-blue-gradient-background wp-block-acf-cta-block"><img decoding="async" alt="Cookiebot bg shield" class="cta-block__shield" height="929" loading="lazy" src="/wp-content/themes/cookiebot/img/backgrounds/cta-shield.svg" width="930"> <div class="cta-block__glass"><div class="container cta-block__inner"><div class="cta-block__left-column"><h2 class="cta-block__title like-h2 no-default-margin"> Is your website privacy compliant? </h2> <div class="cta-block__description like-text-md"><p>With our scanner, you can easily check what cookies and tracking technologies collect user data on your website.</p> </div> <div class="cta-block__form"><form action="https://www.cookiebot.com/en/compliance-test/" class="cb-audit-form" data-results-page="https://www.cookiebot.com/en/compliance-test/" data-scan-type="compliance" id="audit-form-5a84da69-d978-43e3-9872-55eb9c381fbf"><div class="cb-audit-form__input"><div class="cb-field cb-field--size-medium-before-mobile cb-field--text"><label class="cb-field__label" for="field_6ad0831686c24">Your website address</label> <div class="cb-field__wrapper"><input id="field_6ad0831686c24" name="url" type="text"> </div></div> </div> <a data-hid="79d3d2d4" data-pos="3" class="cb-button cb-button-contained cb-button-mobile-size-m cb-button-size-m no-default-link-decoration" href="/" id="e9c07ff8-1df0-405c-a25d-8461de4feec5" target="_self"><span>Scan now</span></a> <div class="audit-form-error"></div></form> <script type="module">new AuditFormInline(
            document.getElementById('audit-form-5a84da69-d978-43e3-9872-55eb9c381fbf'),
            {"scanning_button_text":"Scanning...","error_no_url":"Did you enter your website address in the field above? We could not detect an entry. Can you try again?","error_invalid_url":"Something seems to be missing. Did you add a dot and the letters behind it? Please check your entry one more time.","tracking":{"form_key":"compliance_test","event":"Compliance Scan Requested","category":"Compliance Scan","label_prefix":"compliance-scan-requested-"}}        )</script></div></div> </div> </div></div>

<div class="alignfull bg-brand-white cb-ctx--base cb-flex-row--background-right has-background has-brand-white-background-color wp-block-acf-flex-row" style="padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--8-xl);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--8-xl)"><div class="cb-flex-row container" style="--padding-top: var(--wp--preset--spacing--8-xl); --padding-bottom: var(--wp--preset--spacing--8-xl);"><div class="cb-flex-column wp-block-acf-flex-column" style="--column-size: var(--column-size-12);--i:3"><div class="alignfull cb-ctx--base has-background has-brand-white-background-color hero hero--layout-illustration wp-block-acf-hero" id="hero_2"><div class="hero__inner"><div class="hero__left"><div class="hero__description like-text-lg"><h2 style="margin-top: 16px;">What is a Consent Management Platform?</h2> <p>A Consent Management Platform (CMP) enables businesses to comply with data privacy laws like the GDPR, CCPA and LGPD. It also enables users’ full control over how their data is collected and used, building trust and balancing data privacy with data-driven business.</p> <p>Cookiebot Consent Management Platform (CMP) can help automate the entire technical and legal process of cookie consent on your website. We offer a scalable and highly customizable solution that enables companies to add a customized cookie banner to collect user consent in a compliant way.</p></div> <div class="hero__buttons"><a data-hid="a5b1bce4" data-pos="2" class="cb-button cb-button-contained cb-button-icon-right cb-button-size-l hero__buttons--button-0 no-default-link-decoration" href="/en/cookie-consent-solution/" id="7eaa020f-7b59-4a99-810a-1d67ad062618" target=""><span>learn more</span></a> </div></div> <div class="hero__right"><div class="hero__image-wp"><img decoding="async" alt="What is a Consent Management Platform" class="hero__image" height="511" loading="lazy" sizes="auto, (max-width: 767px) 384px, (max-width: 1023px) 40vw, 50vw" src="https://www.cookiebot.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/09/What-is-a-Consent-Management-Platform.svg?v=b20afb701504fb32" srcset="https://www.cookiebot.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/09/What-is-a-Consent-Management-Platform.svg?v=b20afb701504fb32 150w, https://www.cookiebot.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/09/What-is-a-Consent-Management-Platform.svg?v=b20afb701504fb32 300w, https://www.cookiebot.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/09/What-is-a-Consent-Management-Platform.svg?v=b20afb701504fb32 768w, https://www.cookiebot.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/09/What-is-a-Consent-Management-Platform.svg?v=b20afb701504fb32 1024w, https://www.cookiebot.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/09/What-is-a-Consent-Management-Platform.svg?v=b20afb701504fb32 736w" width="736"> </div> </div></div> </div> </div> </div></div>

<div class="align cb-flex-row wp-block-acf-flex-row" style="padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10-xl);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--5-xl);--padding-top: var(--wp--preset--spacing--10-xl);--padding-bottom: var(--wp--preset--spacing--5-xl)"><div class="cb-flex-column wp-block-acf-flex-column" style="--column-size: var(--column-size-8);--i:4"><h2 class="has-text-align-left wp-block-heading" id="easy-flexible-reliable-privacy-compliancewith-usercentrics-cmp">Achieve easy and automated data privacy compliance with Cookiebot CMP</h2> </div> <div class="cb-flex-column wp-block-acf-flex-column" style="--column-size: var(--column-size-4);--i:5"><p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p> </div></div>

<div class="align cb-flex-row wp-block-acf-flex-row" style="padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10-xl);--padding-top: 0px;--padding-bottom: var(--wp--preset--spacing--10-xl)"><div class="cb-flex-column wp-block-acf-flex-column" style="--column-size: var(--column-size-4);--i:6"><div class="card card--fill-solid card--layout-portrait card--size-m card--type-icon wp-block-acf-card"><div class="card__image-wp"><img decoding="async" alt="" class="card__image" height="65" sizes="(max-width: 64px) 100vw, 64px" src="https://www.cookiebot.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/09/BrandArrow.svg?v=d7715c946477b133" srcset="https://www.cookiebot.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/09/BrandArrow.svg?v=d7715c946477b133 150w, https://www.cookiebot.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/09/BrandArrow.svg?v=d7715c946477b133 300w, https://www.cookiebot.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/09/BrandArrow.svg?v=d7715c946477b133 768w, https://www.cookiebot.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/09/BrandArrow.svg?v=d7715c946477b133 1024w, https://www.cookiebot.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/09/BrandArrow.svg?v=d7715c946477b133 64w" width="64" loading="lazy"> </div> <div class="card__inner"><div class="card__title like-h5"> Easy maintenance on multiple domains </div> <div class="card__description like-text-md"><p class="has-text-align-left">Achieve data privacy compliance with a scalable solution that is straightforward to implement and maintain, easy to use and fully automated.</p> </div></div></div> </div> <div class="cb-flex-column wp-block-acf-flex-column" style="--column-size: var(--column-size-4);--i:7"><div class="card card--fill-solid card--layout-portrait card--size-m card--type-icon wp-block-acf-card"><div class="card__image-wp"><img decoding="async" alt="" class="card__image" height="65" sizes="(max-width: 65px) 100vw, 65px" src="https://www.cookiebot.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/09/BrandSmile.svg?v=95c1b23a0eaf1765" srcset="https://www.cookiebot.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/09/BrandSmile.svg?v=95c1b23a0eaf1765 150w, https://www.cookiebot.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/09/BrandSmile.svg?v=95c1b23a0eaf1765 300w, https://www.cookiebot.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/09/BrandSmile.svg?v=95c1b23a0eaf1765 768w, https://www.cookiebot.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/09/BrandSmile.svg?v=95c1b23a0eaf1765 1024w, https://www.cookiebot.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/09/BrandSmile.svg?v=95c1b23a0eaf1765 65w" width="65" loading="lazy"> </div> <div class="card__inner"><div class="card__title like-h5"> Highly customizable for trustworthy user experience </div> <div class="card__description like-text-md"><p>Improve your data privacy strategy and protect your advertising revenue with a solution that is fully customizable for your business needs.</p> </div></div></div> </div> <div class="cb-flex-column wp-block-acf-flex-column" style="--column-size: var(--column-size-4);--i:8"><div class="card card--fill-solid card--layout-portrait card--size-m card--type-icon wp-block-acf-card"><div class="card__image-wp"><img decoding="async" alt="" class="card__image" height="65" sizes="(max-width: 65px) 100vw, 65px" src="https://www.cookiebot.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/09/BrandUp.svg?v=3c6b84be0e8b4a86" srcset="https://www.cookiebot.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/09/BrandUp.svg?v=3c6b84be0e8b4a86 150w, https://www.cookiebot.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/09/BrandUp.svg?v=3c6b84be0e8b4a86 300w, https://www.cookiebot.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/09/BrandUp.svg?v=3c6b84be0e8b4a86 768w, https://www.cookiebot.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/09/BrandUp.svg?v=3c6b84be0e8b4a86 1024w, https://www.cookiebot.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/09/BrandUp.svg?v=3c6b84be0e8b4a86 65w" width="65" loading="lazy"> </div> <div class="card__inner"><div class="card__title like-h5"> Reliable technology and expertise </div> <div class="card__description like-text-md"><p>Optimize your website performance and stay ahead of technology and regulatory changes with the latest state of the art technology and legal expertise.</p> </div></div></div> </div></div>

<div class="alignfull bg-brand-white cb-ctx--base cb-flex-row--background-right has-background has-brand-white-background-color wp-block-acf-flex-row" style="padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--8-xl);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--8-xl)"><div class="cb-flex-row container" style="--padding-top: var(--wp--preset--spacing--8-xl); --padding-bottom: var(--wp--preset--spacing--8-xl);"><div class="cb-flex-column wp-block-acf-flex-column" style="--column-size: var(--column-size-12);--i:9"><div class="alignfull cb-ctx--base has-background has-brand-white-background-color hero hero--layout-illustration wp-block-acf-hero" id="hero_3"><div class="hero__inner"><div class="hero__left"><div class="hero__description like-text-lg"><h2 style="margin-top: 16px;">Cookiebot consent solution is Google-certified for Consent Mode</h2> <p style="font-size: 15px;">Cookiebot™ is a Google-certified Consent Management Platform (CMP), fully supporting Transparency and Consent Framework (TCF) and Google Consent Mode v2. Starting 2024, Google has mandated the use of Consent Mode for ads personalization, remarketing and analytics in the EU/EEA and Switzerland.<br> Enable Consent Mode with Cookiebot cookie compliance solution to benefit from conversion and analytics modeling, and avoid losing marketing data due to rejected consent banners.</p></div> <div class="hero__tags"><div class="hero__tags-item like-label-s"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" height="10" viewbox="0 0 12 10" width="12"><path d="M3.99913 7.78014L1.21913 5.00014L0.272461 5.94014L3.99913 9.66681L11.9991 1.66681L11.0591 0.726807L3.99913 7.78014Z" fill="#0A9667"></path> </svg> Google Ads </div> <div class="hero__tags-item like-label-s"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" height="10" viewbox="0 0 12 10" width="12"><path d="M3.99913 7.78014L1.21913 5.00014L0.272461 5.94014L3.99913 9.66681L11.9991 1.66681L11.0591 0.726807L3.99913 7.78014Z" fill="#0A9667"></path> </svg> Google Analytics </div> <div class="hero__tags-item like-label-s"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" height="10" viewbox="0 0 12 10" width="12"><path d="M3.99913 7.78014L1.21913 5.00014L0.272461 5.94014L3.99913 9.66681L11.9991 1.66681L11.0591 0.726807L3.99913 7.78014Z" fill="#0A9667"></path> </svg> GDPR </div> <div class="hero__tags-item like-label-s"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" height="10" viewbox="0 0 12 10" width="12"><path d="M3.99913 7.78014L1.21913 5.00014L0.272461 5.94014L3.99913 9.66681L11.9991 1.66681L11.0591 0.726807L3.99913 7.78014Z" fill="#0A9667"></path> </svg> ePrivacy </div></div></div> <div class="hero__right"><div class="hero__image-wp"><img decoding="async" alt="Illustration presenting the Usercentrics Cookiebot CMP banner on app and web and girl holding the Google certified CMP Partner badge" class="hero__image" height="500" loading="lazy" sizes="auto, (max-width: 767px) 384px, (max-width: 1023px) 40vw, 50vw" src="https://www.cookiebot.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2024/10/Cookiebot%E2%84%A2-Consent-Solution-3-1.svg?v=04ca4bca9f8ad7bb" srcset="https://www.cookiebot.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2024/10/Cookiebot™-Consent-Solution-3-1.svg?v=04ca4bca9f8ad7bb 150w, https://www.cookiebot.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2024/10/Cookiebot™-Consent-Solution-3-1.svg?v=04ca4bca9f8ad7bb 300w, https://www.cookiebot.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2024/10/Cookiebot™-Consent-Solution-3-1.svg?v=04ca4bca9f8ad7bb 768w, https://www.cookiebot.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2024/10/Cookiebot™-Consent-Solution-3-1.svg?v=04ca4bca9f8ad7bb 1024w, https://www.cookiebot.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2024/10/Cookiebot™-Consent-Solution-3-1.svg?v=04ca4bca9f8ad7bb 770w" width="770"> </div> </div></div> </div> </div> </div></div>

<div class="alignfull cb-ctx--blue cta-block cta-block--has-shield cta-block--size-m has-background has-background-blue-gradient-background wp-block-acf-cta-block"><img decoding="async" alt="Cookiebot bg shield" class="cta-block__shield" height="929" loading="lazy" src="/wp-content/themes/cookiebot/img/backgrounds/cta-shield.svg" width="930"> <div class="cta-block__glass"><div class="container cta-block__inner"><div class="cta-block__left-column"><div class="cta-block__description like-text-md"><div class="try-cta-title">Try Cookiebot™ today!</div> <div class="try-cta-text">Experience how easy it can be to make your site data privacy compliant.</div></div> <div class="cta-block__buttons"><div class="cta-block__buttons__button-wp"><a data-hid="fd613af4" data-pos="3" class="cb-button cb-button-contained cb-button-icon-right cb-button-size-l cta-block__buttons__button no-default-link-decoration" href="https://admin.cookiebot.com/signup" id="57e7ecc1-d7f8-4bf9-870c-98185752d591" target="_blank"><span> Start free trial</span></a> </div> </div></div> </div> </div></div>

<div class="alignfull card-resource-group card-resource-group--columns-3 wp-block-acf-card-resource-group"><div class="container"><h2>Our latest articles on all things privacy</h2> <div class="card-resource-group__posts"><a data-hid="9362c423" data-pos="1" class="card card--fill-transparent card--layout-portrait card--size-m card--type-image no-default-link-decoration" href="https://www.cookiebot.com/en/personally-identifiable-information-pii-personal-data/" target="_self"><div class="card__image-wp"><img decoding="async" alt="" class="card__image" height="513" src="https://www.cookiebot.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2026/10/CB-Hero-Personally-Identifiable-Information.svg?v=575b06c74e8b61c5" width="770" loading="lazy"> </div> <div class="card__inner"><div class="card__title like-h5"> Personally Identifiable Information: Examples and Why PII Isn't the Same as Personal Data </div> <div class="card__description like-text-md"> PII is a term with no single definition in the U.S. Broadly, it refers to any information that can identify an individual either directly or indirectly. This guide will list the most common examples of... </div> <div class="card__bottom"><div class="card__cta cb-button cb-button-contained cb-button-icon-right cb-button-size-s" id="d8ceaf15-6f9f-4f75-97ab-2d3d9ddba74d"><span></span><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" height="16" width="16"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M10.9396 8.00001L4.74713 3.39331C4.6964 3.35557 4.6665 3.29607 4.6665 3.23285V2.38357C4.6665 2.22188 4.84842 2.12702 4.981 2.21959L12.3332 7.35302C12.7776 7.6725 12.7776 8.32752 12.3332 8.647L4.981 13.7804C4.84842 13.873 4.6665 13.7781 4.6665 13.6164V12.7672C4.6665 12.7039 4.6964 12.6444 4.74713 12.6067L10.9396 8.00001Z" fill="black" fill-rule="evenodd"></path> </svg> </div> </div></div></a> <a data-hid="714fca73" data-pos="1" class="card card--fill-transparent card--layout-portrait card--size-m card--type-image no-default-link-decoration" href="https://www.cookiebot.com/en/cookiebot-configuration-health-checker/" target="_self"><div class="card__image-wp"><img decoding="async" alt="" class="card__image" height="513" src="https://www.cookiebot.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2026/09/CB-Hero-Configuration-Checker-Launch.svg?v=69c03003840b2e4f" width="770" loading="lazy"> </div> <div class="card__inner"><div class="card__title like-h5"> Introducing the Cookiebot Configuration Health Checker: Find Setup Gaps Before They Become Problems </div> <div class="card__description like-text-md"> Cookiebot™ has introduced a self-service Configuration Health Checker, available in the Cookiebot Admin. Now in Beta, it scans your live CMP setup against core... </div> <div class="card__bottom"><div class="card__cta cb-button cb-button-contained cb-button-icon-right cb-button-size-s" id="767b6353-df00-421c-876c-14b71328af0f"><span></span><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" height="16" width="16"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M10.9396 8.00001L4.74713 3.39331C4.6964 3.35557 4.6665 3.29607 4.6665 3.23285V2.38357C4.6665 2.22188 4.84842 2.12702 4.981 2.21959L12.3332 7.35302C12.7776 7.6725 12.7776 8.32752 12.3332 8.647L4.981 13.7804C4.84842 13.873 4.6665 13.7781 4.6665 13.6164V12.7672C4.6665 12.7039 4.6964 12.6444 4.74713 12.6067L10.9396 8.00001Z" fill="black" fill-rule="evenodd"></path> </svg> </div> </div></div></a> <a data-hid="f4768e78" data-pos="1" class="card card--fill-transparent card--layout-portrait card--size-m card--type-image no-default-link-decoration" href="https://www.cookiebot.com/en/iab-tcf-websites/" target="_self"><div class="card__image-wp"><img decoding="async" alt="" class="card__image" height="513" src="https://www.cookiebot.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2026/10/CB-Hero-IAB-TCF-Explained.svg?v=908ceed6a9ab5533" width="770" loading="lazy"> </div> <div class="card__inner"><div class="card__title like-h5"> IAB TCF Explained For Your Website In 2026 </div> <div class="card__description like-text-md"> IAB TCF v2.4 has an implementation deadline of October 23, 2026 for websites. This guide shows what IAB TCF is, what’s new in the upcoming version compared to previous ones, and what you as a website operator can do today to introduce IAB TCF v2.4 and serve... </div> <div class="card__bottom"><div class="card__cta cb-button cb-button-contained cb-button-icon-right cb-button-size-s" id="c8c2abd9-fefd-4da0-9cdf-29914c081760"><span></span><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" height="16" width="16"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M10.9396 8.00001L4.74713 3.39331C4.6964 3.35557 4.6665 3.29607 4.6665 3.23285V2.38357C4.6665 2.22188 4.84842 2.12702 4.981 2.21959L12.3332 7.35302C12.7776 7.6725 12.7776 8.32752 12.3332 8.647L4.981 13.7804C4.84842 13.873 4.6665 13.7781 4.6665 13.6164V12.7672C4.6665 12.7039 4.6964 12.6444 4.74713 12.6067L10.9396 8.00001Z" fill="black" fill-rule="evenodd"></path> </svg> </div> </div></div></a></div></div> </div>

<div class="cb-faqs wp-block-acf-cb-faqs" style="padding-top:0;padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10-xl)"><div class="cb-faqs__heading"><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2> </div> <div class="cb-faqs__list"><noscript><style>.cb-accordion-item__content {
                height: auto !important;
            }</style> </noscript> <div class="cb-accordion-item" id="cb-accordion-item-4"><h5 class="cb-accordion-item__title no-default-margin"><button aria-controls="cb-accordion-item-4-content" aria-expanded="false" class="cb-accordion-item__button" id="cb-accordion-item-4-button"> Who is Cookiebot by Usercentrics? </button> </h5> <div aria-labelledby="cb-accordion-item-4-button" class="cb-accordion-item__content" id="cb-accordion-item-4-content"><div class="cb-accordion-item__content__inner"><p>Cookiebot by Usercentrics provides a plug-and-play compliance solution built around unrivaled scanning technology. It detects and controls all cookies and trackers in use on websites and automatically manages end-user consents.</p> <p>Our solution fits any type of website. Organizations can automate all data privacy requirements online while providing easy and fast consent management for users.</p> <p>Cookiebot Consent Management Platform (CMP) is a self-serve cloud-based service provided by Usercentrics. It enables automated compliance with global data privacy laws like the EU’s GDPR, California’s CCPA/CPRA, Brazil’s LGPD and many others.</p> <p>Read more information <a data-hid="461b3bab" data-pos="2" href="/en/about/">here</a>.</p></div> </div></div> <div class="cb-accordion-item" id="cb-accordion-item-5"><h5 class="cb-accordion-item__title no-default-margin"><button aria-controls="cb-accordion-item-5-content" aria-expanded="false" class="cb-accordion-item__button" id="cb-accordion-item-5-button"> What does a Consent Management Platform (CMP) do on websites? </button> </h5> <div aria-labelledby="cb-accordion-item-5-button" class="cb-accordion-item__content" id="cb-accordion-item-5-content"><div class="cb-accordion-item__content__inner"><p>A consent management platform is a technology that can be implemented on websites and other applications to collect and process personal data from website users and customers. It enables companies to collect and store legally valid consent and helps the end user protect and maintain control over their personal data.</p> </div> </div></div> <div class="cb-accordion-item" id="cb-accordion-item-6"><h5 class="cb-accordion-item__title no-default-margin"><button aria-controls="cb-accordion-item-6-content" aria-expanded="false" class="cb-accordion-item__button" id="cb-accordion-item-6-button"> What is personal data? </button> </h5> <div aria-labelledby="cb-accordion-item-6-button" class="cb-accordion-item__content" id="cb-accordion-item-6-content"><div class="cb-accordion-item__content__inner"><p>Personal data or personal information is information that can be used to identify a person, directly or indirectly, alone or in combination with other pieces of data. </p> <p>Different data privacy regulations have their own specific definitions of personal data, and there can be additional subcategories that require special handling, like sensitive personal data.</p></div> </div></div> <div class="cb-accordion-item" id="cb-accordion-item-7"><h5 class="cb-accordion-item__title no-default-margin"><button aria-controls="cb-accordion-item-7-content" aria-expanded="false" class="cb-accordion-item__button" id="cb-accordion-item-7-button"> What happens if end users don’t give their consent? </button> </h5> <div aria-labelledby="cb-accordion-item-7-button" class="cb-accordion-item__content" id="cb-accordion-item-7-content"><div class="cb-accordion-item__content__inner"><p>If end users decide not to give their consent on a website for processing their personal data, the cookies and trackers that collect data will be blocked. No personal data will be collected, processed or shared with third-party providers. </p> <p>End users’ consent preferences are saved in their web browser and retrieved on future visits to the website.</p></div> </div></div></div></div>


