            }</style><div class="cb-modal-wrapper"><div class="cb-modal image-layout" id="newsletter"><div class="cb-modal__left type-form"><div class="cb-modal__top__image" style="background-image: url(https://www.cookiebot.com/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2023/09/Newsletter-Cookiebot.svg?v=70f9322cde3752dd);"></div> <div class="cb-modal__form--container"><div class="cb-modal__title like-h5">Stay informed</div> <p>Join our growing community of data privacy enthusiasts now. Subscribe to the Cookiebot™ newsletter and get all the latest updates right in your inbox.</p> <form action="javascript:void(0)" class="cb-newsletter-form" data-action="https://www.cookiebot.com/en/wp-json/cb/newsletter-subscribe" data-nonce="072a49b1ca" id="newsletter_6ad08316c6bdb" method="post"><div class="cb-newsletter-form__row--internals"><div class="ff-el-group ff-hpsf-container" style="display: none!important; position: absolute!important; transform: translateX(1000%)!important;"><div class="asterisk-right ff-el-input--label"><label aria-label="Newsletter" for="ff_3_item_sf"> Newsletter </label> </div> <div class="ff-el-input--content"><input class="ff-el-form-control" id="ff_3_item_sf" name="item_3__fluent_sf" type="text"> </div></div> </div> <div class="cb-newsletter-form__row"><div class="cb-field cb-field--email cb-field--size-small"><label class="cb-field__label" for="field_6ad08316c6f4b">Enter your email</label> <div class="cb-field__wrapper"><input id="field_6ad08316c6f4b" name="email" required type="email" value=""> </div></div> <button class="cb-button cb-button-contained cb-button-size-m" id="32fc91ee-9755-45f8-8f85-f5eab84a8412" type="submit"><span>Subscribe</span></button></div> <div class="cb-newsletter-form-legal"> By clicking on “Subscribe” I confirm that I want to subscribe to the Cookiebot&trade; newsletter. I can easily cancel my Cookiebot&trade; newsletter subscription and revoke consent to use my data by clicking the unsubscribe link or I can write to <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="eb9e85989e8998889982898eab9e988e99888e859f99828898c5888486">[email&#160;protected]</a> to make the request. <a data-hid="dd185b47" data-pos="1" href="/en/privacy-policy/" target="_blank">Privacy policy</a>. </div> <input name="__cb_consent_state" type="hidden" value=""> <input name="cbSubmissionType" type="hidden" value="newsletter"> <input name="hidden_utm_source" type="hidden" value=""> <input name="hidden_utm_medium" type="hidden" value=""> <input name="hidden_utm_campaign" type="hidden" value=""> <input name="hidden_utm_content" type="hidden" value=""> <input name="hidden_url" type="hidden" value=""> <input name="hidden_partnerid" type="hidden" value=""> <input name="hidden_language" type="hidden" value="en"> <input name="lead_source" type="hidden" value=""> <input name="lead_source_detail" type="hidden" value=""> <input name="check_news" type="hidden" value="true"> <input name="hidden_utm_history" type="hidden" value=""> <input name="hidden_form_location" type="hidden" value="aside"></form></div></div> <img alt="Close" class="cb-modal__close" height="24" loading="lazy" src="/wp-content/themes/cookiebot/img/icons/direction/Close.svg" width="24"></div> <script data-cfasync="false" src="/cdn-cgi/scripts/5c5dd728/cloudflare-static/email-decode.min.js"></script><script type="module">new Cb_Modal(document.getElementById('newsletter'), document.querySelectorAll('[data-modal-id="newsletter"]'), {"wpcf7":{"12579":[]}});</script> <div class="cb-modal" id="saymine"><div class="cb-modal__left type-iframe"><div class="cb-modal__iframe--container" data-iframe-url="https://usercentrics.privacy.saymine.io/Usercentrics"></div> </div> <img alt="Close" class="cb-modal__close" height="24" loading="lazy" src="/wp-content/themes/cookiebot/img/icons/direction/Close.svg" width="24"></div> <script type="module">new Cb_Modal(document.getElementById('saymine'), document.querySelectorAll('[data-modal-id="saymine"]'), []);</script></div> <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Who is Cookiebot by Usercentrics?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Cookiebot by Usercentrics provides a plug-and-play compliance solution built around unrivaled scanning technology. It detects and controls all cookies and trackers in use on websites and automatically manages end-user consents."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What does a Consent Management Platform (CMP) do on websites?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A consent management platform is a technology that can be implemented on websites and other applications to collect and process personal data from website users and customers. It enables companies to collect and store legally valid consent and helps the end user protect and maintain control over their personal data."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is personal data?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Personal data or personal information is information that can be used to identify a person, directly or indirectly, alone or in combination with other pieces of data."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What happens if end users don\u2019t give their consent?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"If end users decide not to give their consent on a website for processing their personal data, the cookies and trackers that collect data will be blocked. No personal data will be collected, processed or shared with third-party providers."}}]}</script> <div class="cb-footer__cta cb-footer__cta--raw cb-wrapper"><div class="alignfull bg-brand-azure cb-ctx--base cb-flex-row--background-right has-background has-brand-azure-background-color wp-block-acf-flex-row" style="padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10-xl)"><div class="cb-flex-row container" style="--padding-top: var(--wp--preset--spacing--10-xl); --padding-bottom: 0px;"><div class="cb-flex-column wp-block-acf-flex-column" style="--column-size: